/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4908120,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4908120","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T10:12:53Z","value":93,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5221090","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1846651706696620","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"announcement","title":"Outbreak Z is at Steam Next Fest!","summary":"🧟 Outbreak Z is at Steam Next Fest! Hey, survivors! We're excited to share that Outbreak Z is participating in Steam Next Fest, happening right now! 🎉 If you haven't had a chance to try the demo yet, this is the perfect opportunity to jump in, assemble your squad, and take on the zombie hordes! Already played the demo? We'd love to see you come back for another run! We've been listening to your feedback and rolling out improvements, so there's plenty of reason to give it another shot. Every Play","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T20:09:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696620","verified_at":"2026-10-21T08:33:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1846651706675570","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"update","title":"Update: Synthesis Improvements, Loot Rewards & Bug Fixes","summary":"Update: Synthesis Improvements, Loot Rewards & Bug Fixes Hey, survivors! We've got another round of improvements for Outbreak Z! This update makes managing your loot and synthesizing items more convenient, gives you clearer feedback on your rewards, and fixes a few UI issues along the way. Thanks for continuing to share your feedback and helping us make the game better. Here's what's changed! ✨ New Features Synthesis Auto-Fill Filling your Synthesis inputs just got easier! We've added a new Fill","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T20:42:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706675570","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1846018067942224","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update 1.2.0 Is Here — Introducing Loot Rules!","summary":"Demo Update 1.2.0 Is Here — Introducing Loot Rules! Your most-requested demo feature has arrived! Thanks to your feedback in the demo survey, Loot Rules are now available in Demo 1.2.0! Spend less time managing your inventory and more time fighting and exploring. New Feature: Loot Rules Take control of your loot! Click the filter button in your inventory to customize what happens to items when you pick them up. Gear: Choose to Keep, Sell, or Scrap items of each rarity. Junk: Choose to Keep or Sc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T20:34:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942224","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1845383656386834","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo is out!","summary":"krrrsh ...this is the Bunker. The door is open. Repeat, the door is open. krrrsh Hi. Gustavo here, the founder of Frozen Logic. The Outbreak Z demo is live on Steam. Right now. Free. No key, no waitlist, no signup. Scroll up, hit Download Demo, and you are in. Windows and macOS. The Bunker is hiring three positions: Scavenger. Pays for everyone else. The only one who gets grenades. Deadeye. Thin as paper, hits like a train. The only one who can crit. Enforcer. Stands at the front and eats the bi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-02T15:47:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656386834","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1841579228659762","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"announcement","title":"The closed beta round 1 is live","summary":"The closed beta for Outbreak Z has started.Keys are going out on our Discord, and they are free. Join the server, claim a key in the beta channel, activate it on Steam, and go kill things.👉 Join the Discord and claim a keyIt is an early build, so expect rough edges and expect your save to reset as we tune things. Tell us what breaks! We read every report!Keys are limited for this round. More will follow.Mailing list players will get a key in round 2, stay tuned if you are in the list.See you in ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T22:21:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228659762","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:47:39Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4908120-1837955055366296","game_id":"steam-4908120","kind":"announcement","title":"Closed beta signups are open","summary":"Hey everyone!The closed beta for Idle Outbreak Z is open for signups. If you want to play the game before anyone else, and help us shape it while we are still building it, this is the way in.What the beta isAn early build of the game, shared with a small group of players before launch. You play, you tell us what works and what does not, we tune it. The beta is free. It is a test, not a purchase.What you'll be testingThe full loot loop: every zombie drops loot, you gear your squad across four slo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-14T14:32:42Z",